---
const bannerSrc = import.meta.env.BASE_URL + 'banner_youtube.png'
---

<div class="relative overflow-hidden bg-white dark:bg-gray-900">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl">
    <div
      class="relative z-10 bg-white pb-8 sm:pb-16 md:pb-20 lg:w-full lg:max-w-2xl lg:pb-28 xl:pb-32 dark:bg-gray-900"
    >
      <svg
        class="absolute inset-y-0 right-0 hidden h-full w-48 translate-x-1/2 transform text-white lg:block dark:text-gray-900"
        fill="currentColor"
        viewBox="0 0 100 100"
        preserveAspectRatio="none"
        aria-hidden="true"
      >
        <polygon points="50,0 100,0 50,100 0,100"></polygon>
      </svg>

      <main
        class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 pt-10 sm:px-6 sm:pt-12 md:pt-16 lg:px-8 lg:pt-20 xl:pt-28"
      >
        <div class="text-center sm:text-left">
          <h1
            class="text-left text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl dark:text-gray-100"
          >
            <span class="block xl:inline">Notas</span>
            <span class="block xl:inline text-amber-800 dark:text-amber-300">de Rodapé</span>
          </h1>

          <p
            class="mt-3 text-base text-gray-700 sm:mx-auto sm:mt-5 sm:max-w-xl sm:text-lg md:mt-5 md:text-xl lg:mx-0 dark:text-gray-300"
          >
            Um espaço público de escrita e estudo: ideias são reunidas, testadas e reescritas até
            ficarem claras o suficiente para serem lidas de novo — por você e por outros.
          </p>

          <p
            class="mt-3 text-base text-gray-700 sm:mx-auto sm:mt-5 sm:max-w-xl sm:text-lg md:mt-5 md:text-xl lg:mx-0 dark:text-gray-300"
          >
            Comece pela apresentação do projeto, ou explore textos já publicados. Se preferir, a busca
            no topo funciona como atalho: encontre um termo e siga a partir dele.
          </p>

          <div class="mt-5 sm:mt-8 sm:flex sm:justify-center lg:justify-start">
            <div class="rounded-md shadow">
              <a
                href={import.meta.env.BASE_URL + 'about'}
                class="flex w-full items-center justify-center rounded-md border border-transparent bg-amber-800 px-8 py-3 text-base font-medium text-white hover:bg-amber-700 md:px-10 md:py-4 md:text-lg dark:bg-amber-300 dark:text-black dark:hover:bg-amber-200"
              >
                Ler a apresentação
              </a>
            </div>

            <div class="mt-3 sm:mt-0 sm:ml-3">
              <a
                href={import.meta.env.BASE_URL + 'blog'}
                class="flex w-full items-center justify-center rounded-md border border-transparent bg-amber-50 px-8 py-3 text-base font-medium text-amber-900 hover:bg-amber-100 md:px-10 md:py-4 md:text-lg dark:bg-gray-800 dark:text-gray-100 dark:hover:bg-gray-700"
              >
                Explorar textos
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </main>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="bg-amber-50 lg:absolute lg:inset-y-0 lg:right-0 lg:w-1/2 dark:bg-gray-800">
    <div class="flex h-full w-full items-center justify-center p-6 sm:p-8 lg:p-10">
      <img
        class="h-56 w-full object-contain sm:h-72 md:h-96 lg:h-full lg:w-full"
        src={bannerSrc}
        alt="Banner do Notas de Rodapé"
        loading="lazy"
      />
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
